# CHE-96: intermediate field dumps from the demo3 probes. They exist only so a
# route-agreement comparison can be computed across two separately-run routes
# (each route at a converged budget is ~150 s and six runs do not fit in one
# command). Several MB each, regenerable by re-running the probe, and not
# evidence -- the JSON records beside them are.
benchmarks/probes/records/**/*_fields.npz
